flowchart TD
 U[User voice / text] --> UI[Tauri React desktop shell]
 UI --> AV[Avatar renderer and emotion state machine]
 UI --> STT[Local STT whisper.cpp]
 STT --> AD[Agent adapter]
 UI --> AD
 AD --> H[Hermes Agent]
 H <--> LLM[Cloud LLM provider router]
 H --> G[MCP capability gateway]
 G --> P{Permission policy}
 P --> OS[Native OS broker]
 OS --> AP[App discovery / launch]
 OS --> AX[Accessibility tree / actions]
 OS --> SC[Consent-based screenshot fallback]
 H --> TTS[Local Kokoro / Piper TTS]
 TTS --> UI
 H <--> MEM[Opt-in memory SQLite]
